{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics and sounds required during the production process were created with the help of AI tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final result was carefully reviewed and re-edited before use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please take this into consideration before purchasing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The repeated curse of Amalian.<br>Will I be able to survive in the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Former photojournalist Ryan carries a certain trauma from the city<br>and arrives at the remote southern island of \u201cGreenwood Island.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just as he begins to adapt to the peaceful everyday life,<br>cracks begin to appear in the once calm Greenwood Island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The dust-covered lens of his camera begins to shine toward the island\u2019s truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e7d7e13277bd06f1a6f7e264d49c0547.poster.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e7d7e13277bd06f1a6f7e264d49c0547.webm?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e7d7e13277bd06f1a6f7e264d49c0547.mp4?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/059a4fd8323cc4b99e0ac470295cf3fd.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/a3ec2667c1a515e396e62f034b3f66dc.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/dbb8257505c345fb01f13629dc4aec53.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the climax of the prayer during the \u201cHoly Night\u201d ritual, rain falls without exception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone on the island is hiding something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the enchanting scenery lies a layered, dark truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/df51107c9c40c6c32d2397c8e1fc954e.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e963e3e2ad017a99f7a24e1b85d382a4.poster.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e963e3e2ad017a99f7a24e1b85d382a4.webm?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e963e3e2ad017a99f7a24e1b85d382a4.mp4?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/cae234f589ce310c5977b7b2a2d5cd51.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/9a5755cc1d562b8698a4e51612c7acde.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deduction Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth will not be revealed all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross through routes and puzzles to uncover the faith of Amalian and the secrets of Greenwood Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/35a4f7dc301ea1f57dcc1a930c0f1d8c.poster.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/35a4f7dc301ea1f57dcc1a930c0f1d8c.webm?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/35a4f7dc301ea1f57dcc1a930c0f1d8c.mp4?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/2be4ba6e7dd19c3af9b11f6accedd03c.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/1df494e6446a49a6b376e88c984eaff1.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/aaec18afcd8343c03f1faf59b5b4f9b3.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Choices</strong><br>Choices branch into various types: gaining affinity, discovering hints, establishing values, or even death.<br>Some choices may directly lead to death. Careful decision-making is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/bb62fe47e0034e17b9e6c3bbbeb429a6.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/8f83682f5eb43c64df17df9d8d03b4bf.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Interactions, Exploration</strong><br>Explore locations, interact with the environment, obtain hints, and discover items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/3162338446205eae5b594682548f6f13.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/781ea4e5d07f512782d9ab84d65d4dcc.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/26050c3e1309daa8934f40088f16e389.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Item Usage</strong><br>Items can be acquired automatically as the scenario progresses or through exploration.<br>Use the right item to break through critical situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/a56643e1f34f4da51da84165b0026a8c.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/7cf99ff0958e67a0f7b793e6f3a39200.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Escape Room Puzzles</strong><br>Solve puzzles to enter locked doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/f40908d9c3861ca96a8acd680cf14da2.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multi-route &amp; Multi-ending by Values</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your values, the story branches into multiple paths,<br>allowing you to experience many different scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Ryan and pursue the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/dcd7802488d8708b4429595cd016179c.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/6d954dec5b5c9e69188d627ad3ac11b8.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ryan</strong><br>Former photojournalist Ryan enters the remote southern island \u201cGreenwood Island\u201d carrying a certain trauma from the city.<br>At first, he is simply enchanted by the peaceful scenery,<br>but with his arrival, cracks begin to appear in the once tranquil Greenwood Island.<br>His dust-covered camera lens starts pointing toward the island\u2019s truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/9292285e45f1530f4bdc8ff49b489881.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kate</strong><br>Kate runs a small bakery on the island.<br>Always cheerful and playful, she is constantly on the move.<br>She is sociable and lively, but her competitiveness and simplicity sometimes make her look reckless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/fb1d75f0e75ff046689ce35e5e917f5a.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lisa</strong><br>Lisa, the librarian whose true intentions are unknown.<br>She loves books more than anyone and is intelligent and knowledgeable.<br>With her clear speech and sharp demeanor, she always overwhelms her counterpart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/8b066ece44baa81bb3ca9454b3278a39.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grills</strong><br>Grills, the man who runs the barbecue restaurant \u201cGrills\u2019 Delicious Table.\u201d<br>A master of preserving meat juices, always grilling on blazing fire pits.<br>He has a warm and generous personality and takes care of Ryan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/c50960e1b8c81897c122c66eb7081b4e.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martina</strong><br>Martina, the island\u2019s herbalist.<br>Her herbs can be enjoyed as tea or used as medicine.<br>She cares for people with thoughtful concern and speech,<br>though her nagging can sometimes feel like meddling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/52a3df60377d93a49ed1f64c782141df.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eldra</strong><br>Eldra, the young elder who leads the village.<br>On the surface, he is strict and cold,<br>but thanks to his charisma and excellent leadership, the community\u2019s order is maintained.<br>He strictly enforces rules while enjoying the trust of the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/c0e99aebbfc952ce86b7d7a4861f32ec.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joseph</strong><br>Joseph, the elderly owner of the seaside caf\u00e9 \u201cCaf\u00e9 Seabreeze.\u201d<br>Kind and gentle, yet full of wisdom and experience from his years,<br>he spares no advice for Ryan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/fc42998ad1b5f81eabb0e55ae887458f.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amalian</strong><br>Amalian, the mysterious girl worshipped as a saint by the islanders.<br>Whenever she prays, rain falls without fail.<br>The island regards her very existence as a miracle.<br>She is both the spiritual order and the invisible law that governs the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/88baf0d3c2d25970e3809ce4b83b8469.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics and sounds required during the production process were created with the help of AI tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final result was carefully reviewed and re-edited before use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please take this into consideration before purchasing!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790450?t=1760744401","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790450?t=1760744401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/e3aa9e78fb3c11939a2c95ea78d43d1622d48f02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760744401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/e3aa9e78fb3c11939a2c95ea78d43d1622d48f02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760744401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics and sounds required during the production process were created with the help of AI tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final result was carefully reviewed and re-edited before use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please take this into consideration before purchasing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The repeated curse of Amalian.<br>Will I be able to survive in the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Former photojournalist Ryan carries a certain trauma from the city<br>and arrives at the remote southern island of \u201cGreenwood Island.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just as he begins to adapt to the peaceful everyday life,<br>cracks begin to appear in the once calm Greenwood Island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The dust-covered lens of his camera begins to shine toward the island\u2019s truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e7d7e13277bd06f1a6f7e264d49c0547.poster.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e7d7e13277bd06f1a6f7e264d49c0547.webm?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e7d7e13277bd06f1a6f7e264d49c0547.mp4?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/059a4fd8323cc4b99e0ac470295cf3fd.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/a3ec2667c1a515e396e62f034b3f66dc.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/dbb8257505c345fb01f13629dc4aec53.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the climax of the prayer during the \u201cHoly Night\u201d ritual, rain falls without exception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone on the island is hiding something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the enchanting scenery lies a layered, dark truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/df51107c9c40c6c32d2397c8e1fc954e.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e963e3e2ad017a99f7a24e1b85d382a4.poster.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e963e3e2ad017a99f7a24e1b85d382a4.webm?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/e963e3e2ad017a99f7a24e1b85d382a4.mp4?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/cae234f589ce310c5977b7b2a2d5cd51.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/9a5755cc1d562b8698a4e51612c7acde.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deduction Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth will not be revealed all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross through routes and puzzles to uncover the faith of Amalian and the secrets of Greenwood Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/35a4f7dc301ea1f57dcc1a930c0f1d8c.poster.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/35a4f7dc301ea1f57dcc1a930c0f1d8c.webm?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/35a4f7dc301ea1f57dcc1a930c0f1d8c.mp4?t=1760744401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/2be4ba6e7dd19c3af9b11f6accedd03c.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/1df494e6446a49a6b376e88c984eaff1.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/aaec18afcd8343c03f1faf59b5b4f9b3.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Choices</strong><br>Choices branch into various types: gaining affinity, discovering hints, establishing values, or even death.<br>Some choices may directly lead to death. Careful decision-making is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/bb62fe47e0034e17b9e6c3bbbeb429a6.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/8f83682f5eb43c64df17df9d8d03b4bf.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Interactions, Exploration</strong><br>Explore locations, interact with the environment, obtain hints, and discover items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/3162338446205eae5b594682548f6f13.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/781ea4e5d07f512782d9ab84d65d4dcc.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/26050c3e1309daa8934f40088f16e389.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Item Usage</strong><br>Items can be acquired automatically as the scenario progresses or through exploration.<br>Use the right item to break through critical situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/a56643e1f34f4da51da84165b0026a8c.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/7cf99ff0958e67a0f7b793e6f3a39200.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Escape Room Puzzles</strong><br>Solve puzzles to enter locked doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/f40908d9c3861ca96a8acd680cf14da2.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multi-route &amp; Multi-ending by Values</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your values, the story branches into multiple paths,<br>allowing you to experience many different scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Ryan and pursue the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/dcd7802488d8708b4429595cd016179c.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/6d954dec5b5c9e69188d627ad3ac11b8.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ryan</strong><br>Former photojournalist Ryan enters the remote southern island \u201cGreenwood Island\u201d carrying a certain trauma from the city.<br>At first, he is simply enchanted by the peaceful scenery,<br>but with his arrival, cracks begin to appear in the once tranquil Greenwood Island.<br>His dust-covered camera lens starts pointing toward the island\u2019s truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/9292285e45f1530f4bdc8ff49b489881.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kate</strong><br>Kate runs a small bakery on the island.<br>Always cheerful and playful, she is constantly on the move.<br>She is sociable and lively, but her competitiveness and simplicity sometimes make her look reckless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/fb1d75f0e75ff046689ce35e5e917f5a.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lisa</strong><br>Lisa, the librarian whose true intentions are unknown.<br>She loves books more than anyone and is intelligent and knowledgeable.<br>With her clear speech and sharp demeanor, she always overwhelms her counterpart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/8b066ece44baa81bb3ca9454b3278a39.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grills</strong><br>Grills, the man who runs the barbecue restaurant \u201cGrills\u2019 Delicious Table.\u201d<br>A master of preserving meat juices, always grilling on blazing fire pits.<br>He has a warm and generous personality and takes care of Ryan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/c50960e1b8c81897c122c66eb7081b4e.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martina</strong><br>Martina, the island\u2019s herbalist.<br>Her herbs can be enjoyed as tea or used as medicine.<br>She cares for people with thoughtful concern and speech,<br>though her nagging can sometimes feel like meddling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/52a3df60377d93a49ed1f64c782141df.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eldra</strong><br>Eldra, the young elder who leads the village.<br>On the surface, he is strict and cold,<br>but thanks to his charisma and excellent leadership, the community\u2019s order is maintained.<br>He strictly enforces rules while enjoying the trust of the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/c0e99aebbfc952ce86b7d7a4861f32ec.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joseph</strong><br>Joseph, the elderly owner of the seaside caf\u00e9 \u201cCaf\u00e9 Seabreeze.\u201d<br>Kind and gentle, yet full of wisdom and experience from his years,<br>he spares no advice for Ryan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/fc42998ad1b5f81eabb0e55ae887458f.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amalian</strong><br>Amalian, the mysterious girl worshipped as a saint by the islanders.<br>Whenever she prays, rain falls without fail.<br>The island regards her very existence as a miracle.<br>She is both the spiritual order and the invisible law that governs the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/extras/88baf0d3c2d25970e3809ce4b83b8469.avif?t=1760744401\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics and sounds required during the production process were created with the help of AI tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final result was carefully reviewed and re-edited before use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please take this into consideration before purchasing!</p>","developers":["Sayne Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790450/d89fe6f5613f5591b44c41f10f548ed9856976f0/header.jpg?t=1760744401","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or Apple M1/M2 chip or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard sound output (optional)</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"The Secret Of Greenwood Isle","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 / 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectSound-compatible sound card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Sayne Interactive"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nAlkohol / Tabak\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,